<title>USA: Millicom Int'l Q1 subscriber base grows.</title>
<headline>Millicom Int'l Q1 subscriber base grows.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Millicom International Cellular said Tuesday that in the first quarter of 1997 its worldwide subscriber base grew to 582,625 from 504,440.</p>
<p>The largest increase in subscribers were in Asia, where it increased about 136,008 to 316,799.</p>
<p>The cellular telephone operator, based in Luxembourg, said it has increased its subscribers by 93 percent in the last year.</p>
